{
    "_comment": [
        "Q2C Fan PID Control Configuration",
        "Temperature sensors (all on I2C bus 5 = I2C_3V3_5):",
        "  - Ambient_Temp_AFO: TMP75#0 at 0x48 (ambient thermal for AFO)",
        "  - HotSpot_Temp:     TMP75#1 at 0x49 (hot spot thermal)",
        "  - HotSpot_Temp_AFI: TMP75#2 at 0x4A (hot spot thermal for AFI)",
        "  - OP2_Temp:         TMP75#3 at 0x4B (thermal for OP2)",
        "  - CPU_Remote_Temp:  TMP435  at 0x4D (dual-channel, local + CPU remote)",
        "Fan control mechanism: TBD (no dedicated fan controller IC found;",
        "  possibly CPLD/PLD, GPIO PWM, or fan module built-in controllers).",
        "Fan writePath values are PLACEHOLDERS — update after driver bringup."
